   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Imagine you are working for a realtor in your hometown. You are asked to organize the files on the realtor’s computer to make it easier for them to keep up with the properties they are selling and their clients who are looking for homes. The realtor also deals with several rental properties. Design a folder structure that is logical and that will be easy for your boss to manage when new clients or new properties are added.",
